{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 1.05, "end_time_s": 6.1, "duration_s": 5.05, "text": "Cheers to us! Another year of surviving this crazy industry!", "speaker_position": [3.18, 6.64, 1.79], "speaker_size": 0.32}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "shouting", "start_time_s": 6.67, "end_time_s": 11.88, "duration_s": 5.21, "text": "To surviving! And thriving! Mostly thriving, right?", "speaker_position": [1.64, 5.96, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.37}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "laughter", "start_time_s": 12.24, "end_time_s": 17.1, "duration_s": 4.86, "text": "Mostly thriving! But let's be honest, it’s been a bit ardurous lately.", "speaker_position": [0.95, 3.79, 1.74], "speaker_size": 0.34}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 17.46, "end_time_s": 24.97, "duration_s": 7.51, "text": "Oh, absolutely. That project with the marketing team was pure torture. I think my soul left my body twice.", "speaker_position": [3.18, 6.64, 1.79], "speaker_size": 0.32}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 25.5, "end_time_s": 31.55, "duration_s": 6.05, "text": "I know, right? But hey, we made it. And we made it looking good.", "speaker_position": [1.64, 5.96, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.37}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 31.99, "end_time_s": 39.4, "duration_s": 7.41, "text": "Speaking of making it, did you see the new creative brief? It’s so antirealist, I’m not even sure what they want anymore.", "speaker_position": [0.95, 3.79, 1.74], "speaker_size": 0.34}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "shouting", "start_time_s": 39.84, "end_time_s": 47.51, "duration_s": 7.67, "text": "Antirealist? Like, abstract art kind of antirealist? Or just \"make it pop\" antirealist?", "speaker_position": [3.18, 6.64, 1.79], "speaker_size": 0.32}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 47.87, "end_time_s": 54.69, "duration_s": 6.82, "text": "Both! They want something that feels real but isn't, you know? It’s giving me a headache.", "speaker_position": [1.64, 5.96, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.37}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 55.16, "end_time_s": 62.3, "duration_s": 7.14, "text": "It’s giving me a headache too, but at least the budget is healthy. I heard it’s got a strong antitumoral effect on our bank accounts.", "speaker_position": [0.95, 3.79, 1.74], "speaker_size": 0.34}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "laughter", "start_time_s": 62.77, "end_time_s": 69.53, "duration_s": 6.76, "text": "Oh, that’s a great way to put it! An antitumoral budget! It kills the bad spending habits!", "speaker_position": [3.18, 6.64, 1.79], "speaker_size": 0.32}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 69.74, "end_time_s": 76.96, "duration_s": 7.22, "text": "I love it. We should pitch that to the boss. \"Let’s give this project an antitumoral approach.\"", "speaker_position": [1.64, 5.96, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.37}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 77.17, "end_time_s": 83.97, "duration_s": 6.8, "text": "It’s catchy! But seriously, the ardurous part is keeping up with the deadlines. I haven’t slept in days.", "speaker_position": [0.95, 3.79, 1.74], "speaker_size": 0.34}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 84.45, "end_time_s": 88.87, "duration_s": 4.42, "text": "Same here. But look at us, still standing! Still drinking!", "speaker_position": [3.18, 6.64, 1.79], "speaker_size": 0.32}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "en", "vocal_style": "shouting", "start_time_s": 89.39, "end_time_s": 92.9, "duration_s": 3.51, "text": "To still standing! And still drinking!", "speaker_position": [1.64, 5.96, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.37}
